VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
# Optional map tile template (HTTPS, with {z}/{x}/{y}). Defaults to the public
# OpenStreetMap tiles, which suit development and light demos only: switch to a
# commercial or self-hosted tile service before real traffic, and update the
# attribution in src/components/map/LeafletMap.tsx to match the new provider.
# VITE_MAP_TILE_URL=https://tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png
